3231834587,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7AoeHb","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":5,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":5,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3231834587/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-08-28T04:29:27Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3231834587","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10319863?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sholtodouglas","id":10319863,"login":"sholtodouglas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzE5ODYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sholtodouglas","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"The index map in your kernel is out-of-bounds. It should return `(i, 0)` instead of `(i * bq, 0)`. \n\nThe reason that NaNs are appearing is that when XLA's [DynamicSlice](https://openxla.org/xla/operation_semantics#dynamicslice) out of bounds, it will clamp the slice so that it is in-bounds. Since all of the blocks are out of bounds except for the first iteration, they will all get clamped to the last block, so only the first and last blocks in the output get updated. The remaining blocks in the middle are not written to, so they keep their default uninitialized value (NaN).","created_at":"2025-08-28T19:40:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395#issuecomment-3234723631","id":3234723631,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7Azfcv","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3234723631/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-08-28T19:40:39Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3234723631","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justinjfu","id":5401540,"login":"justinjfu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDE1NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Oh wow! thank you for quickly identifying it! ","created_at":"2025-08-29T21:42:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395#issuecomment-3238349738","id":3238349738,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7BBUuq","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3238349738/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-08-29T21:42:33Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3238349738","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216828966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohananil-ant","id":216828966,"login":"rohananil-ant","node_id":"U_kgDODOyMJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justinjfu","id":5401540,"login":"justinjfu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDE1NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/justinjfu","id":5401540,"login":"justinjfu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDE1NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinjfu","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nShows nans on CPU in interp mode.\n\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Minimal reproduction of the Pallas 3+ blocks bug.\"\"\"\n\nimport os\nos.environ['JAX_PLATFORMS'] = 'cpu'\n\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport jax.experimental.pallas as pl\n\njax.config.update('jax_default_matmul_precision', 'float32')\n\n\ndef trivial_kernel(x_ref, o_ref):\n    \"\"\"Trivial kernel that just copies input to output.\"\"\"\n    x = pl.load(x_ref, (slice(None), slice(None)))\n    x = x + 1\n    # Just copy input to output - no computation at all!\n    pl.store(o_ref, (slice(None), slice(None)), x)\n\n\ndef test_trivial():\n    \"\"\"Test if even a trivial kernel has the 3+ blocks bug.\"\"\"\n    \n    print(\"Testing Minimal Pallas Bug Reproduction\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"\\nUsing a trivial kernel that just copies input to output.\")\n    print(\"No arithmetic operations - just load and store.\\n\")\n    \n    bq = 8\n    dim = 16\n    dtype = jnp.float32\n    \n    test_cases = [\n        {\"seq_len\": 16, \"expected\": \"No NaN (2 blocks)\"},\n        {\"seq_len\": 24, \"expected\": \"NaN at pos 8 (3 blocks)\"},\n        {\"seq_len\": 32, \"expected\": \"NaN at pos 8 (4 blocks)\"},\n    ]\n    \n    for test in test_cases:\n        seq_len = test[\"seq_len\"]\n        expected = test[\"expected\"]\n        n_blocks = (seq_len + bq - 1) // bq\n        \n        # Create input - just ones\n        x = jnp.ones((seq_len, dim), dtype=dtype)\n        \n        # Define the grid and specs\n        def index_map(i):\n            return (i * bq, 0)\n        \n        in_spec = pl.BlockSpec((bq, dim), index_map)\n        out_spec = pl.BlockSpec((bq, dim), index_map)\n        \n        # Run the trivial kernel\n        output = pl.pallas_call(\n            trivial_kernel,\n            out_shape=jax.ShapeDtypeStruct((seq_len, dim), dtype),\n            grid=(n_blocks,),\n            interpret=True,\n            in_specs=[in_spec],\n            out_specs=out_spec,\n        )(x)\n        \n        # Check for NaN\n        has_nan = bool(jnp.isnan(output).any())\n        \n        if has_nan:\n            nan_positions = jnp.where(jnp.isnan(output).any(axis=-1))[0]\n            first_nan = nan_positions[0]\n            result = f\"✗ NaN at pos {first_nan} ({len(nan_positions)} total)\"\n        else:\n            result = \"✓ No NaN\"\n        \n        print(f\"seq_len={seq_len}, blocks={n_blocks}: {result}\")\n        print(f\"  Expected: {expected}\")\n        print(f\"  Match: {'✓' if expected.startswith('NaN') == has_nan else '✗'}\")\n        print()\n    \n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"\\nCONCLUSION:\")\n    print(\"If even this trivial kernel produces NaN with 3+ blocks,\")\n    print(\"then it's definitively a Pallas framework bug.\")\n    print(\"\\nThe bug appears to be in how Pallas handles grid execution\")\n    print(\"when there are 3 or more blocks in the grid dimension.\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    test_trivial()\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n  ⎿  jax:    0.7.0.dev20250709    \n     jaxlib: 0.7.0.dev20250709\n     numpy:  1.26.4","closed_at":"2025-08-29T21:42:33Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216828966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohananil-ant","id":216828966,"login":"rohananil-ant","node_id":"U_kgDODOyMJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohananil-ant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":4,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395/comments","created_at":"2025-08-28T00:06:16Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31395","id":3361248941,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","